  55:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h **** /**
  56:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * @brief Finalize a MAVLink message with channel assignment
  57:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  *
  58:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * This function calculates the checksum and sets length and aircraft id correctly.
  59:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * It assumes that the message id and the payload are already correctly set. This function
  60:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * can also be used if the message header has already been written before (as in mavlink_msg_xxx_pa
  61:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * instead of mavlink_msg_xxx_pack_headerless), it just introduces little extra overhead.
  62:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  *
  63:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * @param msg Message to finalize
  64:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * @param system_id Id of the sending (this) system, 1-127
  65:Service/../MAVLink/common/../mavlink_helpers.h ****  * @param length Message length
